================================================================================
Specifications and vectors
================================================================================

The derivation and the test vectors come from the Nano documentation:

    https://docs.nano.org/integration-guides/key-management/
    https://docs.nano.org/integration-guides/the-basics/

The Nano address alphabet and base-32 encoding are defined by the protocol and
are reimplemented here, not copied.
